  <main_text>
    <l n="1" para="true">§. Ista motu proprio peristaltico</l>
    <l n="2">efficiunt, qui pari ratione contractione</l>
    <l n="3">à superna parte versus inferiora perfi-</l>
    <l n="4">citur. Quod si vero inversio fiat istius</l>
    <l n="5">motus, illud fit grave symptoma, quod</l>
    <l n="6">Ileos appellatur.</l>
    <l n="7" para="true">XXIV. <i>Reliquae partes infimi ven-</i>
    </l>
    <l n="8">
      <i>tris suo modo etiam inserviunt chylifica-</i>
    </l>
    <l n="9">
      <i>tioni &amp; sanguificationi. Quippe arteria</i>
    </l>
    <l n="10">
      <i>sanguinem elaboratum in universum corpus</i>
    </l>
    <l n="11">
      <i>devehunt, vena vero à nutritione su-</i>
    </l>
    <l n="12">
      <i>perfluum revehunt, &amp; lactea vena chy-</i>
    </l>
    <l n="13">
      <i>lum ad hepar deducunt.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="14" para="true">§. De quibus vasorum usibus post</l>
    <l n="15">dicemus aliquid.</l>
    <l n="16" para="true">XXV. <i>Sic Pancreas culcitra ad in-</i>
    </l>
    <l n="17">
      <i>star ventriculo substratum est, &amp; calo-</i>
    </l>
    <l n="18">
      <i>rem ejus adjuvat: omentum quoque</i>
    </l>
    <l n="19">
      <i>&amp; ventriculi &amp; intestinorum calorem fo-</i>
    </l>
    <l n="20">
      <i>vet: mesenterium intestina alligata tenet:</i>
    </l>
    <l n="21">
      <i>peritoneum superna parte etiam intestina</i>
    </l>
